Package: ztncui-console
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: xuanranran <noreply@github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: zerotier-one, systemd (>= 247), init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), adduser, iputils-ping
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/xuanranran/ztncui
Description: ZeroTier Console network management interface
 Single-administrator Go and Vue console with an embedded web interface,
 native policy management, live status and bounded ICMP reachability checks.
 Existing controller identities and application databases are preserved.
